The kubernetes provider's v3.4.0 (ci/kubernetes-provider.sh) ported to github.com/getkin/kin-openapi v0.149.0 and later
(#23), applied to its source before the build: openapi2 has its own Schema type, a schema's type is a list
(openapi3.Types), additionalProperties a struct, and extensions are decoded values, no longer json.RawMessage. The
OpenAPI v2 definitions are read as the v3 schemas getTypeFromSchema reads, with the fields it reads, nil where they
are nil (openapi2conv makes every properties map non-nil, which turns maps into unknown types). The v2 fixture's 251
types and hints are the same as v0.111.0's; TestGetTypeByGVKV3Extensions holds a CRD's extensions' hints. The
provider's code, so MPL-2.0. Goes with the build (PROPOSALS.md).

